Error [E0112]: Secret-bearing `Secret` cannot be reflected
  --> tests/ui/crypto_secret_reflect.jet:7:21
    |
  7 |     _ :: reflect.of(secret)
    |                     ^^^^^^
 Why: Reflection would expose a cryptographic secret through generic inspection or display
 Fix: Keep the value opaque; inspect only public keys, signatures, digests, or envelope metadata
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0112
